<title>USA: PHLX, AMEX to list two new options each.</title>
<headline>PHLX, AMEX to list two new options each.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said it would list options on Legg Mason Inc and NGC Corp on Thursday and the American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said it would list options on Family Golf Centers Inc and Globalstar Telecommunications Ltd on Friday.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbol and the options' strike prices, expiration months, position limits (in number of contracts) and specialist unit.  </p>
<p>Strikes	Exp Month   Pos Lts   Specialist</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>40, 45, 50   May, Jun,   4,500     Spear, Leeds</p>
<p>		 Aug, Nov		  &amp; Kellogg</p>
<p>15, 17-1/2,  May, Jun,   4,500     Spear, Leeds</p>
<p>20	     Sep, Dec		  &amp; Kellogg</p>
<p>17-1/2, 20,  May, Jun,   4,500     LETCO-Specialist</p>
<p>22-1/2	 Aug, Nov		  LP</p>
<p>45, 50, 55   May, Jun,   4,500     Spear, Leeds</p>
<p>		 Sep, Dec		  &amp; Kellogg</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
</text>
